# text = In a kindly pity for him , we began to say and it was resolved that he should be comforted on his next appearance amongst us ; but , lo ! he came down upon us , untouched by any sense of shame , speaking loud and bass as ever , his head thrown back , his wig as jaunty and well-curled as usual , and we were obliged to conclude he had forgotten all about Sunday .
