# text = But I did not add to Miss Matty's anxieties by naming my suspicions , especially as Fanny said to me , the next day , that it was such a queer kitchen for having odd shadows about it , she really was almost afraid to stay she added However , it so fell out that Fanny had to leave and Miss Matilda begged me to stay and " settle her " with the new maid ; to which I consented , after I had heard from my father that he did not want me at home .
