# text = The earliest set of letters were two bundles tied together , and ticketed ( in Miss Jenkyns's handwriting I should guess that the rector of Cranford was about twenty-seven years of age when he wrote those letters ; and Miss Matty told me that her mother was just eighteen at the time of her wedding .
