# text = One day , when Miss Jenkyns and her hosts were at a dinner-party in Newcastle , this warning summons was actually given ( not a very wise proceeding , if there be any truth in the moral attached to the fable of the Boy and the Wolf ; but so it was ), and Miss Jenkyns , hardly recovered from her fright , wrote the next day to describe the sound , the breathless shock , the hurry and alarm ; and then , taking breath , she added And here Miss Matty broke in with Peter Marmaduke Arley Jenkyns as Miss Matty began to call him ) was at school at Shrewsbury by this time .
