# text = She accordingly mixed a saucerful for him , and put it down for him to lap ; and then she told us how intelligent and sensible the dear little fellow was ; he knew cream quite well , and constantly refused tea with only milk in it : so the milk was left for us ; but we silently thought we were quite as intelligent and sensible as Carlo , and felt as if insult were added to injury when we were called upon to admire the gratitude evinced by his wagging his tail for the cream which should have been ours .
