# text = This last was from Miss Matty Lady Glenmire asked replied Miss Matty , rather confused at the moment to remember which was astronomy and which was astrology -- but the answer was true under either circumstance , for she read , and was slightly alarmed at Francis Moore's astrological predictions ; and , as to astronomy , in a private and confidential conversation , she had told me she never could believe that the earth was moving constantly , and that she would not believe it if she could , it made her feel so tired and dizzy whenever she thought about it .
