# text = He looked at her again , with the same dignified upbraiding in his countenance she repeated more positively than ever Miss Pole's energetic speeches had the good effect of wakening up Mrs Jamieson , who opened her eyes wide , in sign of the deepest attention -- a proceeding which silenced Miss Pole and encouraged the Grand Turk to proceed , which he did in very broken English -- so broken that there was no cohesion between the parts of his sentences ; a fact which he himself perceived at last , and so left off speaking and proceeded to action .
