# text = Miss Matty made no secret of being an arrant coward , but she went regularly through her housekeeper's duty of inspection -- only the hour for this became earlier and earlier , till at last we went the rounds at half-past six , and Miss Matty adjourned to bed soon after seven Cranford had so long piqued itself on being an honest and moral town that it had grown to fancy itself too genteel and well-bred to be otherwise , and felt the stain upon its character at this time doubly .
