# text = The former came upstairs , carrying a little hand-basket , and she was evidently in a state of great agitation said she to me , as I offered to relieve her of her basket said Miss Matty answered Miss Pole We might have triumphed over Miss Pole , who had professed such bravery until she was frightened ; but we were too glad to perceive that she shared in the weaknesses of humanity to exult over her ; and I gave up my room to her very willingly , and shared Miss Matty's bed for the night .
