# text = Miss Pole was evidently anxious to prove that such terrible events had occurred within her experience that she was justified in her sudden panic ; and Miss Matty did not like to be outdone , and capped every story with one yet more horrible , till it reminded me oddly enough , of an old story I had read somewhere , of a nightingale and a musician , who strove one against the other which could produce the most admirable music , till poor Philomel dropped down dead .
