# text = The family were away in London , and a pedlar came by , and asked to leave his large and heavy pack in the kitchen , saying he would call for it again at night ; and the girl ( a gamekeeper's daughter ), roaming about in search of amusement , chanced to hit upon a gun hanging up in the hall , and took it down to look at the chasing ; and it went off through the open kitchen door , hit the pack , and a slow dark thread of blood came oozing out . ( How Miss Pole enjoyed this part of the story , dwelling on each word as if she loved it !)
