# text = I had wondered what we should all do if thus awakened and alarmed , and had proposed to Miss Matty that we should cover up our faces under the bedclothes so that there should be no danger of the robbers thinking that we could identify them ; but Miss Matty , who was trembling very much , scouted this idea , and said we owed it to society to apprehend them , and that she should certainly do her best to lay hold of them and lock them up in the garret till morning .
