# text = Lady Glenmire , after waiting and listening for some time in the drawing - room , had proposed to Mrs Jamieson that they should go to bed ; but that lady said she should not feel comfortable unless she sat up and watched ; and , accordingly , she packed herself warmly up on the sofa , where she was found by the housemaid , when she came into the room at six o'clock , fast asleep ; but Lady Glenmire went to bed , and kept awake all night .
