# text = She had talked herself out of breath , and we should have been very glad to fill up the necessary pause as chorus , but we did not exactly know what to say , or which man had suggested this diatribe against the sex ; so we only joined in generally , with a grave shake of the head , and a soft murmur of said she exclaimed the chorus Miss Pole exclaimed , angry that we could be for a moment imposed upon After we had duly condemned the want of candour which Mr Hoggins had evinced , and abused men in general , taking him for the representative and type , we got round to the subject about which we had been talking when Miss Pole came in ; namely , how far , in the present disturbed state of the country , we could venture to accept an invitation which Miss Matty had just received from Mrs Forrester , to come as usual and keep the anniversary of her wedding-day by drinking tea with her at five o'clock , and playing a quiet pool afterwards .
