# text = Miss Pole came round with a swing to as vehement a belief in the sorrowful tale as she had been sceptical before ; and , as a proof of this , her energy in the poor sufferer's behalf was nothing daunted when she found out that he , and no other , was our Signor Brunoni , to whom all Cranford had been attributing all manner of evil this six weeks past !
