# text = Miss Pole came with her little basket at all hours of the evening , as if her lonely house and the unfrequented road to it had never been infested by that " murderous gang "; Mrs Forrester said she thought that neither Jenny nor she need mind the headless lady who wept and wailed in Darkness Lane , for surely the power was never given to such beings to harm those who went about to try to do what little good was in their power , to which Jenny tremblingly assented ; but the mistress's theory had little effect on the maid's practice until she had sewn two pieces of red flannel in the shape of a cross on her inner garment .
