# text = Miss Pole drew herself up at this remark of Lady Glenmire's , and said But here Lady Glenmire broke in with a very strong expression of doubt as to whether this last story was not an entire fabrication founded upon the theft of a cat ; she grew so red while she was saying all this that I was not surprised at Miss Pole's manner of bridling up , and I am certain , if Lady Glenmire had not been we should have had a more emphatic contradiction than the and similar fragmentary ejaculations , which were all that she ventured upon in my lady's presence .
