# text = For instance , I remember asking Miss Pole ( and I thought the question was very opportune , for I put it when I met her at a call at Mrs Forrester's , and both the ladies had known Peter , and I imagined that they might refresh each other's memories )-- I asked Miss Pole what was the very last thing they had ever heard about him ; and then she named the absurd report to which I have alluded , about his having been elected Great Lama of Thibet ; and this was a signal for each lady to go off on her separate idea .
