# text = In vain I put in They only joined issue to dispute whether llamas were carnivorous animals or not ; in which dispute they were not quite on fair grounds , as Mrs Forrester ( after they had grown warm and cool again ) acknowledged that she always confused carnivorous and graminivorous together , just as she did horizontal and perpendicular ; but then she apologised for it very prettily , by saying that in her day the only use people made of four-syllabled words was to teach how they should be spelt .
