# text = I don't know whether it is a fancy of mine , or a real fact , but I have noticed that , just after the announcement of an engagement in any set , the unmarried ladies in that set flutter out in an unusual gaiety and newness of dress , as much as to say , in a tacit and unconscious manner Miss Matty and Miss Pole talked and thought more about bonnets , gowns , caps , and shawls , during the fortnight that succeeded this call , than I had known them do for years before .
