# text = He used to say and by the time he had done his last breakfast , he came to some other friend who was beginning dinner ; but come what might in the way of temptation , Tom was always sober , civil , and smiling ; and , as Miss Jenkyns used to say , it was a lesson in patience , that she doubted not would call out that precious quality in some minds , where , but for Thomas , it might have lain dormant and undiscovered .
