# text = I had once said , on receiving a present of an elaborate pair , that I should feel quite tempted to drop one of them in the street , in order to have it admired ; but I found this little joke ( and it was a very little one ) was such a distress to her sense of propriety , and was taken with such anxious , earnest alarm , lest the temptation might some day prove too strong for me , that I quite regretted having ventured upon it .
