# text = Miss Matty and I sat assenting to accounts , and schemes , and reports , and documents , of which I do not believe we either of us understood a word ; for my father was clear-headed and decisive , and a capital man of business , and if we made the slightest inquiry , or expressed the slightest want of comprehension , he had a sharp way of saying And as we had not comprehended anything of what he had proposed , we found it rather difficult to shape our objections ; in fact , we never were sure if we had any .
