# text = She talked me to sleep at last , and then I was awakened by a slight sound at the door , for which she begged my pardon as she crept penitently into bed ; but it seems that when I could no longer confirm her belief that the long-lost was really here -- under the same roof -- she had begun to fear lest it was only a waking dream of hers ; that there never had been a Peter sitting by her all that blessed evening -- but that the real Peter lay dead far away beneath some wild sea-wave , or under some strange eastern tree .
